# Project Architecture

`docs/project-specification.md` is the single source of truth. If any document,
comment, or rule conflicts with it, the specification wins.

## Structure

- `src` layout; the only importable package is `sales_call_agent`.
- Subpackages mirror the pipeline: `ingestion` -> `audio` -> `transcription` ->
  `diarization` -> `speaker_identity` -> `evaluation`, with `rubric` and
  `knowledge_base` supporting evaluation.

## Layering rules

- `domain` contains core models and business rules only. It must not import
  I/O, database, or framework code (no SQLAlchemy, FastAPI, psycopg).
- Pipeline packages may depend on `domain`, never on `api`.
- `api` (FastAPI) orchestrates and must not contain business logic.
- All database access goes through `persistence`; other packages must not open
  connections or embed SQL.
- New cross-cutting decisions get an entry in `docs/decisions.md`.
